Subject: [PATCH 066/913] dts: stm32mp21: define scmi regulator consumer

Define voltage regulator exposed by the SCMI server using the device
tree compatible node st,scmi-regulator-consumer for STM32MP21 platforms.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 2a95d3942ca246fc5c37dba4efcebbd38e791bde dts: stm32mp21: define scmi regulator consumer]
Change-Id: I7fbebadb9abef2faed33c4b9dbb5e14692db9a31
---
 .../regulator/st,stm32mp21-regulator.h        | 48 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 48 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 core/include/dt-bindings/regulator/st,stm32mp21-regulator.h

diff --git a/core/include/dt-bindings/regulator/st,stm32mp21-regulator.h b/core/include/dt-bindings/regulator/st,stm32mp21-regulator.h
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..aac642636
